<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        background-color: #efeef1;
        font-family: HelveticaNeue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .footer {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
        color: #706a7b;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .logo {
        text-align: center;
        padding-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .logo img {
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: 150px;
        height: auto;
      }
      .sections-borders {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .section-border {
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);
        width: 249px;
      }
      .section-center {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d50057;
        width: 102px;
      }
      .paragraph {
        line-height: 1.5;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .changes-box {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
      .change-label {
        color: #706a7b;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }
      .change-arrow {
        color: #d50057;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0 6px;
      }
      .new-value {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      .old-value {
        color: #706a7b;
        text-decoration: line-through;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo">
        <img width="150" src="{{logo}}" alt="Trajetto Logo" />
      </div>

      <div class="sections-borders">
        <div class="section-border"></div>
        <div class="section-center"></div>
        <div class="section-border"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p class="paragraph">Olá {{name}},</p>
        <p class="paragraph">
          <strong>{{performingUserName}}</strong>
          ({{performingUserEmail}}) atualizou sua conta Master no Trajetto.
          Abaixo estão as alterações realizadas:
        </p>

        {{#if hasFieldChanges}}
          <div class="changes-box">
            {{#if oldName}}
              <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                <span class="change-label">Nome</span><br />
                <span class="old-value">{{oldName}}</span>
                <span class="change-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="new-value">{{newName}}</span>
              </p>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if oldEmail}}
              <p style="margin: 0;">
                <span class="change-label">E-mail</span><br />
                <span class="old-value">{{oldEmail}}</span>
                <span class="change-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="new-value">{{newEmail}}</span>
              </p>
            {{/if}}
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <p class="paragraph">
          Se você não reconhece esta alteração, entre em contato com nossa
          equipe de suporte imediatamente para proteger sua conta.
        </p>

        <p class="paragraph">
          Obrigado,<br />
          Equipe |
          <strong>Trajetto</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} Trajetto, Todos os direitos reservados</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>